<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Falling for Ya - From "Teen Beach Movie"/Soundtrack Version</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Grace Phipps</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Teen Beach Movie</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5hK2Ks25jW6aMmUAHpAN3F</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.800" end="00:19.370">The day started ordinary, boys walking by</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.370" end="00:25.790">It was the same old story, too fresh or too shy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.790" end="00:29.470">I'm not the kind to fall for a guy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.470" end="00:33.090">Who flashes a smile (it goes on for miles)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.090" end="00:36.540">Don't usually swoon, but I'm over the moon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.540" end="00:39.800" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">('Cause he was just too cool for school)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.800" end="00:44.410">And now I'm falling for ya, falling for ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.410" end="00:46.490">I know I shouldn't, but I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.490" end="00:48.110">I just can't stop myself from</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.110" end="00:51.920">Falling for ya, falling for ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.920" end="00:53.700">Can't hold on any longer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.700" end="00:56.660">And now I'm falling for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.660" end="00:59.010" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.010" end="01:03.330" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.330" end="01:05.950">Now we're goin' steady</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.950" end="01:10.600">He's the cat's meow (meow, meow)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.600" end="01:17.430">He says I'm a Betty and we paint the town</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.430" end="01:20.920">I'm not the kind to fall for a guy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.920" end="01:24.650">Just 'cause he says, "Hi" (when he's cruisin' by)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.650" end="01:28.520">He's ready to race and I'm catching his gaze</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.520" end="01:31.660" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Down-low, on like this for days)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.660" end="01:36.100">And now I'm falling for ya, falling for ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.100" end="01:38.190">I know I shouldn't, but I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.190" end="01:39.950">I just can't stop myself from</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.950" end="01:43.680">Falling for ya, falling for ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.680" end="01:45.490">Can't hold on any longer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.490" end="01:48.050">And now I'm falling for ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.050" end="01:51.740">It feels like I tumbled from another world</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.740" end="01:55.340">Into your arms and it's so secure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.340" end="01:58.940">Maybe I'll stumble, but I know for sure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.940" end="02:06.010">Head over heels, I'm gonna be your girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.010" end="02:14.010" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.440" end="02:38.980">And now I'm falling for ya, falling for ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.980" end="02:40.740">I know I shouldn't, but I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.740" end="02:42.620">I just can't stop myself from</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.620" end="02:46.370">Falling for ya, falling for ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.370" end="02:48.220">Can't hold on any longer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.220" end="02:51.490">And now I'm falling for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.490" end="02:55.490" /></div></body></tt>